1
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:09,576
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,856 --> 00:00:12,723
=Episode 14=

3
00:00:12,843 --> 00:00:15,603
(Concubine Rou silences a witness.)

4
00:00:15,883 --> 00:00:18,095
(Longfu Gate)

5
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:18,720
Chunli.

6
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:20,560
From this day on,

7
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,160
take good care of Jinxuan.

8
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:23,880
I want her to

9
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:25,840
stay healthy

10
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:26,880
and happy.

11
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:28,320
Yes.

12
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:29,400
Your Highness.

13
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:31,800
Rong.

14
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:34,320
My dear daughter.

15
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:37,480
I've heard the news.

16
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:39,080
You've been made Consort Rong.

17
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:40,160
Our family

18
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:41,720
finally has a bright future.

19
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:42,720
I always knew

20
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:44,280
you were destined for greatness.

21
00:00:48,080 --> 00:00:48,800
Rong.

22
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,320
Now that you've risen,

23
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:52,440
don't forget me and the Fu family.

24
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:55,080
I know you've suffered,

25
00:00:55,080 --> 00:00:56,000
and you're resentful.

26
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:57,760
But all these years,

27
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:58,880
I raised you for your own good.

28
00:00:58,880 --> 00:00:59,640
For my own good?

29
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:01,320
That's why

30
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:03,000
you cozied up to Noble Consort Hui,

31
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:04,560
helped her do evil,

32
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:06,160
and abused your own daughter.

33
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:07,840
Then you expected me to

34
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:09,560
let Lingxi's death go unavenged.

35
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:12,560
Well, well.

36
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:14,320
Now that you're a consort,

37
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:15,200
you've grown bold.

38
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:17,400
How dare you question your own mother?

39
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:19,480
I think

40
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:22,840
you've forgotten what this bell can do.

41
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:37,280
What...

42
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:39,280
The bell doesn't work...

43
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:43,760
Because I treated you as family,

44
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:45,320
and had hopes for you,

45
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:47,920
I feared this bell for all these years.

46
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:50,480
Just because I'm a girl,

47
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:53,000
you've humiliated me since childhood.

48
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:57,520
You taught me

49
00:01:57,960 --> 00:01:58,840
that in this world,

50
00:01:58,840 --> 00:02:01,440
some mothers truly
don't love their children.

51
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:03,360
Rong.

52
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:04,960
Please, hear me out.

53
00:02:05,240 --> 00:02:06,520
I only wanted what's best for you.

54
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,120
Enough!

55
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:09,480
Stop pretending.

56
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,360
Our bond as mother and daughter

57
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,560
ends here today.

58
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:16,440
From this day on,

59
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:18,240
we go our separate ways.

60
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:20,760
From now on,

61
00:02:20,760 --> 00:02:21,760
the Fu family and I

62
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:25,920
cut all ties!

63
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:32,600
- You wretch!
- Your Highness!

64
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:33,880
You little wretch!

65
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:36,160
You rise and forget your roots.

66
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:37,680
I'll beat you to death!

67
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:38,720
How dare you!

68
00:02:43,880 --> 00:02:44,680
You...

69
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,640
You dare strike Consort Rong?

70
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:47,800
Have you a death wish?

71
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:48,800
Let go!

72
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,640
Your Highness.

73
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:52,960
Eunuch Liu.

74
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:55,040
His Majesty pities Your Highness

75
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:57,120
for all the wrongs your family has done.

76
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,480
He has ordered me

77
00:02:58,640 --> 00:03:00,240
to vent your anger.

78
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:05,800
By His Majesty's decree.

79
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,280
Zhao, a guilty woman,

80
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:10,760
has insulted a consort,

81
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,400
conspired with Noble Consort Hui,

82
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:14,160
and plotted against the heir.

83
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:15,440
She has defied the throne.

84
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:16,520
Her crimes are unforgivable.

85
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:17,240
She shall be

86
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:19,360
given fifty strokes of the cane

87
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:20,920
as a warning to all.

88
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:23,240
The entire Fu family
shall be punished as well.

89
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:26,360
All their lands and property are seized.

90
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:27,640
They are banished from the capital.

91
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,600
They may never hold office again.

92
00:03:29,880 --> 00:03:31,000
They shall beg in the streets.

93
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:32,360
Let all know the fate

94
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:34,000
of the unkind and disrespectful.

95
00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:35,680
Drag her out.

96
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:39,320
Now that you're a consort...

97
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:39,680
Move.

98
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:41,080
You live in luxury,

99
00:03:41,440 --> 00:03:43,000
yet you disown your family.

100
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:44,320
You ungrateful wretch!

101
00:03:44,720 --> 00:03:45,920
May you die a horrible death!

102
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:47,160
Carry out the execution.

103
00:03:57,200 --> 00:03:58,560
You ungrateful wretch!

104
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:00,840
May you die a horrible death!

105
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:12,600
(Lingxi.)

106
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,920
(My mother doesn't love me.)

107
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:18,560
(But I love you.)

108
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,760
(Women in this world)

109
00:04:21,760 --> 00:04:23,120
(have always had it hard.)

110
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,480
(They are looked down upon,)

111
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:26,560
(and controlled by others,)

112
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:28,240
(with no say in anything.)

113
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:30,840
(Because of your muteness,)

114
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,920
(you suffered bullying and scorn.)

115
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:34,800
(They insulted you,)

116
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:35,880
(laughed at you,)

117
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,120
(and bullied you.)

118
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:39,160
(And in the end, they killed you.)

119
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:42,000
(I will never)

120
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:44,800
(forgive the one who stole your voice.)

121
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:49,120
(No matter how hard it gets,)

122
00:04:50,080 --> 00:04:51,200
(no matter the obstacles,)

123
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:53,840
(no matter the cost,)

124
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:57,240
(I will see to it)

125
00:04:58,240 --> 00:05:00,120
(that you get justice.)

126
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,800
(Noble Consort Hui's contempt)

127
00:05:10,840 --> 00:05:12,200
(wasn't faked.)

128
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:13,840
(It seems)

129
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:16,240
(she wasn't the one who muted Lingxi.)

130
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:27,800
Physician Li, what else?

131
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:28,640
Your Highness.

132
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:31,600
While sorting through old records,

133
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:33,320
I came across a record

134
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:35,120
from when Lingxi was born ten years ago.

135
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:37,280
What's wrong with it?

136
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,600
For infant jaundice,

137
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:40,360
when caused by internal damp-heat,

138
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:42,000
goldthread​ clears heart fire

139
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,160
and dispels dampness and toxins.

140
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:44,080
That's the proper remedy.

141
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:46,320
But if someone used the wrong herb,

142
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:49,080
mistaking ginger-prepared
goldthread​ for it...

143
00:05:57,840 --> 00:05:58,880
Look.

144
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:02,920
It's...

145
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:04,560
You may not know this,

146
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:06,360
but in Princess Lingxi's records,

147
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:08,600
both the prescription and pharmacy log

148
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:09,840
list only goldthread​.

149
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,040
There's no sign of foul play.

150
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,640
But raw goldthread​ has little scent,

151
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,400
the ginger-prepared kind
smells of ginger.

152
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:16,200
Even an experienced palace apothecary,

153
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:18,120
without smelling or tasting,

154
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,440
might fail to notice it

155
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:21,240
by sight alone.

156
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:23,720
Prepared with ginger juice,

157
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,160
its bitter, cooling nature is reduced,

158
00:06:25,320 --> 00:06:27,160
and its warming,
dispersing effects increase.

159
00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:28,280
It first attacks the throat.

160
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:30,080
An infant's throat is delicate.

161
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:31,200
Toxic heat builds up,

162
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,400
causing the throat to swell.

163
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,360
The airway becomes blocked.

164
00:06:33,640 --> 00:06:34,720
In milder cases,

165
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,680
the voice becomes hoarse.

166
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:37,880
In severe cases,

167
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:39,360
mute for life.

168
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:46,520
So?

169
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,400
So...

170
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:51,880
If someone deliberately
used the wrong herb,

171
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:53,560
then Princess Lingxi

172
00:06:53,840 --> 00:06:55,320
was not born mute.

173
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:57,200
She may have been

174
00:06:58,360 --> 00:06:59,320
poisoned and rendered mute after birth.

175
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:10,760
Your Highness.

176
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,520
(Since the day Lingxi was born,)

177
00:07:23,960 --> 00:07:26,280
(I never once heard her call me mother.)

178
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:30,040
(She was poisoned into silence.)

179
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:32,760
(Why?)

180
00:07:33,320 --> 00:07:34,960
(Why would anyone do such a thing)

181
00:07:34,960 --> 00:07:36,120
(to an innocent child?)

182
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:39,160
(She was made to endure a lifetime of)

183
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,280
(scorn, mockery)

184
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:42,360
(and humiliation.)

185
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:47,040
(I thought it was just our bad fate.)

186
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:49,640
(I thought if I kept to myself)

187
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:51,880
(and stay out of the harem's
cruel schemes,)

188
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:54,280
(I could survive in peace.)

189
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,760
(I was wrong.)

190
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:01,280
(Children are innocent and lovely.)

191
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:03,760
(They are blameless.)

192
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:06,600
(They should be protected.)

193
00:08:08,640 --> 00:08:12,120
(But the harem is a place of
such darkness.)

194
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:15,920
(The Imperial Hospital
was meant to heal,)

195
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:18,560
(yet it has become a tool
in power struggles.)

196
00:08:20,320 --> 00:08:22,320
(Whoever silenced my child,)

197
00:08:23,280 --> 00:08:24,720
(whoever it may be,)

198
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,840
(I will expose her.)

199
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:29,960
(I will also tear apart the demon)

200
00:08:30,280 --> 00:08:32,360
(hiding in this harem
who preyed on children.)

201
00:08:32,920 --> 00:08:34,560
(May she never)

202
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:36,160
(find peace in the next life.)

203
00:08:44,560 --> 00:08:45,360
Your Highness.

204
00:08:46,920 --> 00:08:48,120
I have completed

205
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,360
the investigation you ordered.

206
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:50,040
What did you find?

207
00:08:50,040 --> 00:08:51,360
Your suspicion was correct.

208
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:52,360
As you instructed,

209
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:54,240
I checked that consort's
medical records.

210
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:56,280
During the same period as Lingxi's

211
00:08:56,280 --> 00:08:57,840
jaundice treatment,

212
00:08:58,040 --> 00:08:59,320
she was the only one

213
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:01,280
who also had a prescription
filled there.

214
00:09:01,520 --> 00:09:02,440
And her prescription

215
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:03,880
did contain ginger-prepared goldthread​.

216
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,440
It really was her.

217
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:09,080
A newborn baby in swaddling clothes

218
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:10,200
was no threat to her.

219
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,720
Why would she do it?

220
00:09:13,040 --> 00:09:14,480
Since entering the palace,

221
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,760
I kept to myself,

222
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:19,280
never had any conflicts with anyone.

223
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:23,240
I've thought it over
these past few days.

224
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:26,520
There may be one thing
she resented me for.

225
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:27,400
What is it?

226
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:29,640
Not long after I entered the palace,

227
00:09:29,920 --> 00:09:32,280
His Majesty held a banquet
for the consorts.

228
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:34,360
I had to attend.

229
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:36,040
But as it happened,

230
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:37,840
that day

231
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:38,920
I wore the wrong dress.

232
00:09:38,920 --> 00:09:41,760
It was the same purple peony gown
as hers.

233
00:09:42,200 --> 00:09:44,240
His Majesty praised my delicate look.

234
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:46,720
She looked displeased

235
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,720
and left early.

236
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:49,640
Could that be the reason

237
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:50,640
she hated me?

238
00:09:51,040 --> 00:09:52,440
So she waited for a chance revenge.

239
00:09:52,800 --> 00:09:54,680
All because you wore the same dress,

240
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:56,920
she could stoop to harming a baby?

241
00:09:57,520 --> 00:09:59,320
She's always seemed so generous.

242
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:01,000
Was it all an act?

243
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:08,040
I must verify this myself.

244
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:09,640
If it really was her,

245
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:12,400
I will never let her off.

246
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:24,680
Your Highness.

247
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,680
Word from the Imperial Hospital.

248
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:29,080
Consort Rong went there this afternoon

249
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:32,120
to check the records of
Lingxi's jaundice treatment.

250
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:34,440
Poor Consort Rong.

251
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:36,880
Her child was ill-fated too,

252
00:10:37,160 --> 00:10:38,840
killed by Noble Consort Hui.

253
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,280
I feel for her.

254
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,720
Let her investigate.

255
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:48,280
Your Highness.

256
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:49,640
Rise, have a seat.

257
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:51,520
We were just talking about you.

258
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:54,480
I've just received a bolt of silk,

259
00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:56,080
a gift from His Majesty.

260
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:57,360
Newly sent Shu brocade.

261
00:10:57,840 --> 00:10:59,080
Just look at it.

262
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:00,200
It shimmers like gold.

263
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,400
Isn't it lovely?

264
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:03,280
I thought I'd bring it to you.

265
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:04,680
How thoughtful of you.

266
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:07,480
Your tea, Your Highness.

267
00:11:09,040 --> 00:11:10,120
Quick, Yinshuang,

268
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,280
bring the burn salve.

269
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:12,080
Yes.

270
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:15,080
Are you all right?

271
00:11:15,640 --> 00:11:16,440
I'm fine.

272
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:18,560
I'll never forget

273
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:20,240
your kindness, Sister.

274
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:22,080
Speaking of which,

275
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:24,120
when I first met you,

276
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:26,040
I was wearing a dress
just like this one.

277
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,360
It had

278
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:29,240
peonies embroidered on it too.

279
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:32,400
You mean the banquet

280
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:34,000
when Xihe was just born,

281
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:36,640
and His Majesty invited the harem
to celebrate?

282
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:38,800
I must confess,

283
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:41,480
you'd only just entered the palace then,

284
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:42,920
I didn't know you yet.

285
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:45,120
Then Xihe spat up milk.

286
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:46,800
I'd just given birth,

287
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:48,440
and it was my first child.

288
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:50,280
I was at a loss.

289
00:11:50,520 --> 00:11:52,040
I couldn't attend to everyone,

290
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:53,800
so I left without a word.

291
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:56,320
If I'd known you then,

292
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:57,560
I could have helped you.

293
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,880
You wouldn't have suffered so much.

294
00:12:03,640 --> 00:12:04,440
Here.

295
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:13,480
Sister, your medicinal herbs

296
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:14,680
have such an unusual scent.

297
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:16,680
Why does it smell of ginger?

298
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:18,920
Oh, these?

299
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,640
My health is frail,

300
00:12:20,960 --> 00:12:22,320
so I keep some herbs on hand

301
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:23,600
in case I need them.

302
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:25,120
They're quite effective.

303
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:26,640
Concubine Rou sent them.

304
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:28,280
Whenever her illness flares up,

305
00:12:28,280 --> 00:12:29,840
I brew a dose and it helps at once.

306
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:30,880
It works wonders.

307
00:12:31,760 --> 00:12:33,240
Concubine Rou sent them?

308
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:34,920
It's an old ailment.

309
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:36,040
I get headaches often.

310
00:12:36,280 --> 00:12:38,200
So she found folk remedies

311
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:40,360
from a famous physician for me.

312
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:42,200
It's just goldthread​.

313
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:43,960
Nothing special.

314
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:47,520
(Consort Qi seems quite frank.)

315
00:12:48,520 --> 00:12:49,840
(But this ginger-prepared goldthread​...)

316
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:52,680
(She seems to be covering for
Concubine Rou.)

317
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:54,760
(Was it Concubine Rou)

318
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,360
(who silenced Lingxi?)

319
00:13:03,560 --> 00:13:06,160
(Dongmei was the maid
who brewed the medicine.)

320
00:13:06,760 --> 00:13:08,400
(She knew about medicine.)

321
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:11,280
(That's why I entrusted
the task to her.)

322
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:14,680
(I even told her to inspect
every ingredient.)

323
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:16,840
(She brewed it every day,)

324
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:17,960
(surrounded by herbs.)

325
00:13:18,120 --> 00:13:19,640
(She did so for half a month.)

326
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:22,040
(How could she not smell)

327
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:23,880
(the ginger in those herbs?)

328
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:27,040
Someone jumped down the well!

329
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:28,200
Someone jumped down the well!

330
00:13:28,233 --> 00:13:29,153
Someone jumped down the well!

331
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:30,080
It looks like Dongmei!

332
00:13:30,400 --> 00:13:31,360
I think it's Dongmei!

333
00:13:31,400 --> 00:13:32,320
Hurry!

334
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:36,360
It really is Dongmei.

335
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:41,320
Your Highness.

336
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:42,240
It's strange...

337
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:44,640
Dongmei just threw herself
into the well and drowned.

338
00:13:53,360 --> 00:13:53,920
Your Highness.

339
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:54,840
This fabric looks like

340
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:56,520
the new Fuguang brocade from Jiangnan.

341
00:13:56,840 --> 00:13:59,000
His Majesty gave it only
to Concubine Rou.

342
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:03,360
Silencing her so fast...

343
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,040
(Concubine Rou.)

344
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:06,600
(Was it really you?)

345
00:14:06,920 --> 00:14:09,080
(You're the one hiding the deepest.)

346
00:14:09,760 --> 00:14:11,160
(Sweet words, deadly intentions.)

347
00:14:11,640 --> 00:14:13,720
(You poisoned my daughter
and silenced her!)

348
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:16,000
(If it was you,)

349
00:14:16,400 --> 00:14:17,960
(I'll tear you apart!)

350
00:14:20,580 --> 00:14:25,060
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

351
00:14:25,500 --> 00:14:30,100
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

352
00:14:30,300 --> 00:14:34,900
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

353
00:14:35,140 --> 00:14:39,740
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

354
00:14:40,020 --> 00:14:44,500
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

355
00:14:44,940 --> 00:14:49,540
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

356
00:14:49,740 --> 00:14:54,340
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

357
00:14:54,700 --> 00:14:59,300
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

358
00:14:59,460 --> 00:15:04,060
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

359
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:07,620
♪Let the stars and sea♪

360
00:15:07,620 --> 00:15:08,940
(Changsheng Gate)

361
00:15:08,940 --> 00:15:12,820
♪Wait for your return♪
